rtion of children aged <6 years\"}]}], \"methods_quotes\": [{\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"The 2000 IRAR was a self-administered questionnaire distributed to immunization program managers or immunization registry managers\"}, {\"loc\": \"text\", \"q\": \"because IRAR 2000 relied on self-reported information, some bias is expected\"}], \"confidence\": \"medium\", \"uncertain_fields\": [\"study_design\"]}", "type": "text"}]}